  "description": "Ahn Do-young is admitted to hospital following a sudden road accident. There, he meets his attending doctor, Ki Tae-yoon. Ahn Do-young falls in love with him at the first sight of his kind care and a single smile, and firmly believes that Tae-yoon’s tenderness is a sign that he intends to propose marriage to him exclusively. However, upon realising this is not the case, Do-young loses his mind and begins to express misguided desires. *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/erotomania)",
